<title>UK: UBS pharma analysts move to Warburg.</title>
<headline>UBS pharma analysts move to Warburg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceuticals analysts Mark Clark and David Grogan have left UBS for SBC Warburg, Warburg said on Monday.</p>
<p>An SBC Warburg spokesman told Reuters the two analysts would augment its existing analyst team, which includes Stuart Donachie.</p>
<p>Clark and Grogan have made a habit of moving in tandem, joining UBS from Nomura.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
